324668696343_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X0TOtMaBAVEQ7kNvwFLVMcK&_nc_oc=Adq7875yuf_ogwnLzQ6cZRlv2mL1dSgNeBoT1AvrwqP_7YLIg2o-MqMCFiWALkYNXLM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJde-JP4PbP9Cra4IMWU6RApXv3PquHfOU5rpsXF7F6UQ&oe=6AAFE368"}, {"file_name": "Main_Scene_Custom..._12.09.2026_11-21-58.png", "id": "1956335489027579", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596068480_1956335492360912_1124545892435771756_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xe65-ci0-iQQ7kNvwHDD0sd&_nc_oc=Adp_ltPEB5rKtFWQiRD_mklG1w6UIaduFsPlhzWY_wt0hqasDiblriEu0n8kHogK1JA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI_u_XbjITBbBcTwEZxnT23T4my5gVzoQKmThThN8VvCg&oe=6AAFE96B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Huss Room's", "keywords": ["Rooms", "Backrooms", "Huss", "VR"], "long_description": "# Huss Room's\n\nA Gorilla Tag fangame set in the Backrooms.\n\n**Huss Room's** takes the movement you know from Gorilla Tag and drops you into the Backrooms \u2014 an endless network of shifting levels, from the buzzing fluorescent halls of the Lobby to the Poolrooms and beyond. Explore with friends, find your way between levels, and watch out for what's lurking in the walls.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Multiple levels** \u2014 explore different Backrooms areas, including the iconic Level 0, Poolrooms, and Train Station\n- **Gorilla Tag-style movement** \u2014 climb, swing, and move using the same physical mechanics you already know\n- **Multiplayer co-op** \u2014 team up with friends to explore and survive together\n- **Level transitions** \u2014 find hidden ways to move between levels as you go\n\n## The Rules Are Simple\n\nStick together. Watch your step. Keep exploring.\n\nHow deep into the Huss Room's can you go?", "short_description": "Huss Room's is a Gorilla Tag fangame that takes the movement and multiplayer spirit you know and drops it into the Backrooms \u2014 an endless, shifting maze of levels. Start in the buzzing fluorescent halls of Level 0, then find your way into the Poolrooms, the Train Station, and beyond. Using the same climbing and swinging movement mechanics from Gorilla Tag, team up with friends to explore each level, uncover hidden transitions, and see how deep into the Huss Room's you can go together."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gorillagamesinc-privacy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mat", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gorillagamesinc/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28618354107803019"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673658581_1756333342176806_2558805447171439985_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w-_5Po68n5sQ7kNvwFxc3Nb&_nc_oc=Adph_Rzz_df8VU3ZYunYVKnL86h-XV7UNNpZM619hf-VW6481vTPLKr09jlmfpwnRII&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKMJRpecb-i5SddCoI3u1-BKNYpCSzZtdBVB6Vm3LOZeQ&oe=6AAFFBE4"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Huss Room's", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"c